{"4991050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SHH!", "steam_appid": 4991050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silence is your greatest weapon... and your greatest weakness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SHH! is a first-person psychological horror game where every sound you make could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped inside a terrifying environment stalked by a relentless creature that hunts by sound, you'll need to think before every step. Walk too loudly, move the wrong object, or activate the wrong device, and the monster will know exactly where you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use radios and boomboxes to lure the creature away, carefully manage your batteries, and race against time to retrieve the key that unlocks your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In SHH!, survival isn't about fighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's about staying quiet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic sound-based monster AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action generates noise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global Noise Meter that tracks your danger level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different floor surfaces create different sound levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use radios and boomboxes as distractions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited batteries and resource management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-sensitive objectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple environmental puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense Quick Time escape encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive first-person psychological horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No weapons. No combat. Only survival.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with game obstacles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991050/extras/75fc62e555659bbd55f9e0a450a63b05.poster.avif?t=1786990742\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991050/extras/75fc62e555659bbd55f9e0a450a63b05.webm?t=1786990742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991050/extras/75fc62e555659bbd55f9e0a450a63b05.mp4?t=1786990742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Time Events allows for narrow escapes and a heart pounding gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991050/extras/833e4b71b332e22a92a7683a95caa360.poster.avif?t=1786990742\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991050/extras/833e4b71b332e22a92a7683a95caa360.webm?t=1786990742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991050/extras/833e4b71b332e22a92a7683a95caa360.mp4?t=1786990742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silence is your greatest weapon... and your greatest weakness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SHH! is a first-person psychological horror game where every sound you make could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped inside a terrifying environment stalked by a relentless creature that hunts by sound, you'll need to think before every step. Walk too loudly, move the wrong object, or activate the wrong device, and the monster will know exactly where you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use radios and boomboxes to lure the creature away, carefully manage your batteries, and race against time to retrieve the key that unlocks your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In SHH!, survival isn't about fighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's about staying quiet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic sound-based monster AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action generates noise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global Noise Meter that tracks your danger level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different floor surfaces create different sound levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use radios and boomboxes as distractions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited batteries and resource management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-sensitive objectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple environmental puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense Quick Time escape encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive first-person psychological horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No weapons. No combat. Only survival.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with game obstacles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991050/extras/75fc62e555659bbd55f9e0a450a63b05.poster.avif?t=1786990742\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991050/extras/75fc62e555659bbd55f9e0a450a63b05.webm?t=1786990742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991050/extras/75fc62e555659bbd55f9e0a450a63b05.mp4?t=1786990742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Time Events allows for narrow escapes and a heart pounding gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991050/extras/833e4b71b332e22a92a7683a95caa360.poster.avif?t=1786990742\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991050/extras/833e4b71b332e22a92a7683a95caa360.webm?t=1786990742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991050/extras/833e4b71b332e22a92a7683a95caa360.mp4?t=1786990742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Survive by controlling the one thing you can't avoid making: sound. Every noise brings the monster closer. Think before every step, use sound to your advantage, manage limited resources, and escape before silence becomes your greatest enemy.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991050/15f7925388e05a671d10cb05cd216b2d3d357810/header.jpg?t=1786990742", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991050/1a5e9a51423deaa84195769c6eda971043511b0d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786990742", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991050/1a5e9a51423deaa84195769c6eda971043511b0d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786990742", "website": "https://vincintech.net/#my_games_on_homepage", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3500U or Intel i3 1115G4<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel UHD graphics or AMD Radeon Vega 8<br></li><li><s